## Ruling summary (operative law)
1. Per-kind honesty (all 8): behavior + example = lawful Gherkin; workflow, rule,
   constraint, model, decision, contract = Markdown (mapping would lie).
2. Rich content by physical form: Feature/Scenario description prose lawful only on
   MD-19 owners (narrative | description). Gherkin DocStrings and DataTables remain
   refused. Physical source locations preserved; hard cap of 100 semantic findings retained.
3. "Universal" = per-ID carriers + generated Gherkin-shaped READ projection (not one
   default authored carrier; not a lossless codec).
4. Default does not flip; Markdown remains default Spec carrier.
5. Packs out; MD-25 remains Pack carrier law.
ADR three-part test addressed in rationale (hard to reverse · surprising without
context · real trade-off). MD-27 kind bound reaffirmed, not overturned.

